() Tj
T* (Here is the zip file containing the complete source code for the ) Tj
T* (Web Dashboard and the Mobile App. Please follow these instructions ) Tj
T* (to set everything up on your machine or deployment server.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (PART 1: Setting up the Web Dashboard \(Production Build\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Install Dependencies) Tj
T* (After extracting the zip file, open your terminal, navigate into ) Tj
T* (the 'designbhk-admin' folder, and install all required packages:) Tj
T* (> npm install) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Configure Environment Variables) Tj
T* (Create a new file in the root folder named '.env.local' and paste ) Tj
T* (the following database and security credentials into it:) Tj
T* (DATABASE_URL="postgresql://neondb_owner:npg_FUWYEH4kdfL3@ep-blue-bread-at1czyea.) Tj
T* (c-9.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require") Tj
T* (JWT_SECRET="designbhk-super-secret-jwt-key-2024-admin") Tj
T* (NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Generate Database Client) Tj
T* (Run this command to synchronize the Prisma client:) Tj
T* (> npm run postinstall) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. Build for Production) Tj
T* (Compile the Next.js application into an optimized production build:) Tj
T* (> npm run build) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. Start the Production Server) Tj
T* (Start the live production server:) Tj
T* (> npm run start) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (PART 2: Building the Mobile App \(For Android/Google Play\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Install Mobile Dependencies) Tj
T* (Open a new terminal, navigate into the 'mobile-app' folder:) Tj
T* (> cd mobile-app) Tj
T* (> npm install) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Install Expo Build Tools) Tj
T* (> npm install -g eas-cli) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Build the Android App Bundle) Tj
T* (> eas build -p android) Tj
T* (\(This will ask you to log into an Expo account. Once the build ) Tj
T* (finishes, it will give you a direct link to download the .aab file\)) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
